OFFICE OF THE KAZEKAGE -- RECORDS OF THE FIRST KAZEKAGE

Preserved for the archive of village founding. The First Kazekage was the
shinobi who united the desert clans of the Land of Wind and, with the sanction
of the Wind Daimyo, established Sunagakure as a Hidden Village in the age when
the great villages first formed.

Founding principles set down in his time:
- The village serves the Daimyo of Wind in exchange for the funding that
  sustains it across the barren land (see the standing funding agreement).
- Strength through scarcity -- the desert's hardship is forged into the
  discipline of its shinobi. Every resource is accounted for.
- The Kazekage is first among the village's warriors and answers for its fate.

Little of the First's personal techniques survives in open record; his legacy
is the institution itself. His charter remains the root of Sunagakure law. This
file is maintained alongside the founding charter under Kazekage seal.
